Vendored restorer and JPEG graphs used by AFRBench's FR-system pipeline.

These copies are trimmed for inference (no facelib detect/paste, no RealESRGAN,
no ImageNet/CIFAR DiffPure). Runtime code must not import ``code_references/``.

