DiffJPEG
  Upstream: https://github.com/mlomnitz/DiffJPEG
  Commit:   a5767fe (HEAD as cloned)
  Files:    afrbench/fr_system/diffjpeg/
  License:  MIT; see afrbench/fr_system/diffjpeg/LICENSE.
  Note:     DiffJPEG is not libjpeg. There is no Huffman coding; chroma uses
            a synthetic 4:2:0 average-pool. Output may be non-integer.

A thin no-op ARCH_REGISTRY / default_init_weights / get_root_logger lives in
registry.py so these graphs do not need pip ``basicsr``.
